            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Dry air can wreak havoc on your nose and lungs, making breathing uncomfortable. If you are someone with pre-existing conditions, dry air can make those circumstances even worse. Without proper humidification, the air can be anywhere from discomfited to downright unbearable.</p><p>So, humidifiers really are a preventative measure. Maintaining and improving your health through humidification means taking care of the air in your home.</p>",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
