            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>Blueair Invisible, Mist-Free Technology</h4><p>Blueair’s InvisibleMist™ technology provides clean, balanced moisture without stickiness, water residue, or white dust, thanks to a wick filter that traps minerals and pollutants. The humidifier emits up to 48 hours of clean moisture by trapping water impurities in the wick filter, releasing pure water vapor into the air.</p><p>This lack of mist from the product reduces concern over moisture problems, while the UV-powered water pump recirculates water, helping to inhibit the risk of bacteria growth that thrives in still water. Our Blueair Humidifier provides all the benefits of humidification while preventing common issues through its advanced, superior design. </p>",
